      "description": "The whole loop across both processes. Pick an `invalidation` id and the chain reads: sync.invalidated (the push left) -> ui.invalidation.received (matched of mounted) -> ui.query.read (rows, ms). `matched: 0` while a surface is open means the write side and the read side disagree about the topic; `matched` equal to everything mounted means the topic is too coarse.",
